Falsifies `capability_plan::proofs::a_missing_route_refuses_rather_than_falling_through_to_a_slot`.

The defect is the one the harness's doc names: a role the supervisor routes nothing to falls
through to slot 0, `unwrap_or(0)` in place of the `let ... else { return Err }`. Slot 0 is the
supervisor's construction budget in every program in this tree, so the child is endowed with it.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(n0 == "a" && n1 == "b")`: `plan` returned `Ok` for a shape where one
role was never routed.

